; Everyport's words on the NSIS welcome and finish pages. Tauri includes this
; file before the pages, so these defines replace the stock wizard text.
!define MUI_WELCOMEPAGE_TITLE "Install Everyport"
!define MUI_WELCOMEPAGE_TEXT "Everyport shows every dev server on this PC and on the machines you connect to, from the tray.$\r$\n$\r$\nIt installs for your account only and doesn't need admin rights."
!define MUI_FINISHPAGE_TITLE "Everyport is ready"
!define MUI_FINISHPAGE_TEXT "Everyport lives in the tray, next to the clock. If you don't see the Socket icon, open the ^ menu there."
